@page "/Account/AccessDenied"

<PageTitle>Access denied</PageTitle>

<header>
    <h1 class="text-danger">Access denied</h1>
    <p class="text-danger">You do not have access to this resource.</p>
</header>

<p>
    The admin pages open only for an invited admin who has a second factor. If you are signed in, add a
    <a href="Account/Manage/Passkeys">passkey</a> or an
    <a href="Account/Manage/TwoFactorAuthentication">authenticator app</a>, then go back to the
    <a href="/">votes</a>. If you still cannot get in, ask an admin to check that your account is an admin account.
</p>
